<title>SWITZERLAND: OZ Holding buys back 60,000 shares.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding buys back 60,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding said it had bought back 60,000 of its own bearer shares under a previously announced offer.</p>
<p>&quot;Pending approval of an extraordinary general shareholders meeting on August 8, 1997, the share capital will be reduced by 600,000 Swiss francs to 5.4 million,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The number of outstanding bearer shares would also drop by 60,000 to 540,000,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
